    "0": {
      "key": [
        "vesper",
        "city",
        "arcology",
        "skyline"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "vesper",
      "content": "Vesper is a city of stacked tiers: gleaming arcologies above the cloud line, and beneath them a maze of neon canyons where the rain never quite stops. The upper tiers belong to the corps — clean air, clean light, clean records. The lower tiers keep the city running: the cargo lifts, the power substations, the market stalls lit by salvaged signage. Everyone in the lower tiers knows the skyline by heart, because it is the only ceiling they will ever get.",
