    "3": {
      "key": [
        "hazel",
        "hazel's gift",
        "gift",
        "implant",
        "hearing"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "hazelsgift",
      "content": "Hazel hears the dead channel through a salvaged cochlear implant she rebuilt herself — the corps marked it defective, which is exactly why it works. The implant floods her ears with the channel's ghost traffic, and she has learned to sort it the way a sailor sorts wind: patterns, moods, approaching storms. It makes her the best fixer in the Stacks and the most wanted listener in Vesper. She has never told anyone the whole story of how she found it.",
